////1-Power Cell NiMH Hump Battery 3000mAh 8.4V 7S iD (Part # 2926X)
////1-4 AMP DC NiMH Battery Charger (Part # 2975)
////This product is compatible with the following Model(s): Traxxas 1/10 Telluride 4x4 (Model 67044), Telluride 4x4

Kit includes: 1) CTA MR-FP50 Mini Battery Charger for Sony NP-FH100; 2) Spare NP-FH100 Battery; 3) Additional Spare NP-FH100 Battery; 4) Precision Design 5-Piece Cleaning Kit. &diams; 

CTA MR-FP50 Mini Battery Charger includes: Car Adapter; European Plug; Instructions; CTA USA Warranty. &diams; 

This kit is fully compatible with most Sony Handycam Camcorders that use the NP-FH100 including DCR-SR200, DCR-SR300, DCR-SR62, DCR-SR82. &diams; The CTA Mini Rapid Multi-voltage Charger plugs directly in to your wall outlet or your car's cigarette lighter and charges your digital camera's battery in approximately 60 to 90 minutes. Its unique flat pin, foldable design allows easy storage and makes it the most compact battery charger on the market! &diams; A spare battery will enable consistent high speed shooting, more flash shots, image review and playback and operating in low temperature conditions without worrying if you will have enough power to get all the shots you want. The spare battery will not put constraints on how you want to shoot. Memory Free! It can be charged at any time without harm, even if it already has a partial charge and can be typically charged over 1000 times.
